{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなりですが！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんの好きな数字は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19と29なんです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故かと言うと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19は出席番号がずっと19番で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"29はお誕生日の数字だから〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んで、どっちにも入っている9も好きなんですヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、\nなんでいきなりこの数字っ⁈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんこれから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9.19.29になった方には名前付きで質問返ししますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\n9の付く数字は生駒ちゃんが気まぐれで9人選んで質問返ししますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"説明わかったかな〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのブログみて生駒もやらなきゃな〜って思っててね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、どうせならちょっとスペシャルな感じにしようと思いました〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問はこのブログから返させてもらいます〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/11/09/3308545/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんぜひ参加して下さいね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/11/09/3308545/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}